# nufi-box mesh.caddy rev 2
# caddy/mesh.caddy — the box's sites on its mesh address.
#
# This is the empty template. install-box.sh copies it to caddy/mesh.caddy
# (gitignored) so a fresh box imports nothing, and `nufi-box mesh up`
# overwrites that copy with the five real site blocks once the box has joined
# a coordinator and knows its BOX_MESH_HOST and BOX_MESH_IP. `nufi-box mesh
# down` puts this file back.
#
# Do not edit caddy/mesh.caddy by hand: mesh up rewrites it.
#
# The `rev` on the first line is the stamp lib/mesh.sh checks (MESH_CADDY_REV
# there): a copy of this file on a box that predates a change to the Caddyfile
# snippets the generated sites import gets re-rendered instead of taking the
# whole front door down. Bump both together, or neither.
